---
import Layout from '../components/layout/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | Love4Prompts" 
  description="Learn why we built the fastest platform to discover, recreate, and use viral AI image trends in seconds." theme="editorial">
  
  <div class="flex flex-1 relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden">
    {/* Background Massive Text */}
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none select-none overflow-hidden pt-20">
      <span 
        class="text-[#e8e8e8] font-bold tracking-tighter whitespace-nowrap" 
        style="font-size: clamp(80px, 20vw, 320px); line-height: 0.8;"
      >
        VISION
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="w-full relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 pt-24 pb-16">
      <div class="mb-16 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-black text-white rounded-full font-bold tracking-widest text-[12px] uppercase mb-6 shadow-[4px_4px_0_#FF6D87] border-2 border-black">
          Our Story
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-black font-black uppercase tracking-tighter text-[48px] md:text-[72px] leading-[0.9] mb-4">
          See The Trend.<br />
          <span class="text-[#1482A3] drop-shadow-[2px_2px_0_#000]">Be The Trend.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-black font-medium text-[16px] sm:text-[20px] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mt-4">
          Love4Prompts is the fastest platform to discover, recreate, and use viral AI image trends in seconds.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Manifest Cards */}
      <div class="space-y-8 mb-16">
        <div class="bg-white border-[4px] border-black rounded-[24px] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#000] relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2.5 h-full bg-[#FF6D87]"></div>
          <h2 class="text-black font-black uppercase text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-4 pl-4">We are NOT another prompt library</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-4">
            We are not a catalog of random technical instructions, nor are we another prompt-base clone. We are the outcome-first hub for trending AI image aesthetics. Users come to Love4Prompts because they saw a viral image on Instagram, TikTok, Reels, Shorts, or Pinterest and want to recreate it with their own face or custom characters.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border-[4px] border-black rounded-[24px] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#000] relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2.5 h-full bg-[#1482A3]"></div>
          <h2 class="text-black font-black uppercase text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-4 pl-4">The problems we solve</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 pl-4">
            If you've ever scrolled through social media and wanted to make a viral image yourself, you know the frustration:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 pl-4 font-bold text-black text-sm uppercase">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-[#FF3B30] border border-black rounded-full"></span> 
              Endless comment loops (\"DM me prompt\")
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-[#FF3B30] border border-black rounded-full"></span> 
              Searching through creator profiles to find links
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-[#FF3B30] border border-black rounded-full"></span> 
              Time spent reverse engineering complex formulas
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mt-4 pl-4">
            We remove all these friction points by providing the <strong>Trend</strong>, the <strong>Prompt</strong>, and a <strong>One-Click Launch</strong> directly into the AI model.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border-[4px] border-black rounded-[24px] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#000] relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-2.5 h-full bg-[#06D6A0]"></div>
          <h2 class="text-black font-black uppercase text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-4 pl-4">Recreate trends in 3 steps</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pl-4 mt-6">
            <div class="border-2 border-black p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#06D6A0]/10 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xs mb-2 shadow-[2px_2px_0_#FF6D87] border border-black">1</div>
              <h3 class="font-black uppercase text-sm mt-2">Find Trend</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">Browse the latest viral layouts from TikTok, Instagram & Pinterest.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-2 border-black p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#1482A3]/10 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xs mb-2 shadow-[2px_2px_0_#FFD166] border border-black">2</div>
              <h3 class="font-black uppercase text-sm mt-2">Launch Model</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">Click Create Image to automatically prepare the prompt for ChatGPT.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-2 border-black p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#FF6D87]/10 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xs mb-2 shadow-[2px_2px_0_#06D6A0] border border-black">3</div>
              <h3 class="font-black uppercase text-sm mt-2">Add Photo</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">Upload your own photo as a reference, generate, and become the trend!</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="/library" class="magnetic-btn inline-block bg-[#FF6D87] text-white px-8 py-4 border-[3px] border-black rounded-full font-black text-lg uppercase tracking-wider shadow-[6px_6px_0_#000] hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[8px_8px_0_#1482A3] transition-all">
          Explore Viral Trends Now
        </a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
